    "title": "Catching up with SEC Network's Alyssa Lang about the Razorbacks - NewsBreak",
    "text": "FAYETTEVILLE, Ark. (KNWA/KFTA) – SEC Media Days is taking place in Atlanta this week and our Courtney Mims had a chance to sit down with SEC Network’s Alyssa Lang this week. She talked with Courtney about what she expects out of the Razorbacks this season. You can watch the full interview in the video at the top of the page next to the headline. Arkansas will take the stage at the College Football Hall of Fame on Thursday at noon. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KNWA FOX24.",
